{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04339","headline":"将军行 · 刘希夷","name":"将军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军辟辕门，耿介当风立。\n诸将欲言事，逡巡不敢入。\n劒气射云天，鼓声振原隰。\n黄尘塞路起，走马追兵急。\n弯弓从此去，飞箭如雨集。\n截围一百里，斩首五千级。\n代马流血死，胡人抱鞍泣。\n古来养甲兵，有事常讨袭。\n乘我庙堂运，坐使干戈戢。\n献凯归京师，军容何翕习。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}